==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{q|obsolete}} {{l|en|systematick}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr}} {{m|fr|systématique}}, from {{etyl|grc}} {{m|grc|συστηματικός}}, from {{suffix|grc|σύστημᾰ|-ῐκός|nocat=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK|US}} {{IPA|/ˌsɪs.təˈmæt.ɪk/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-systematic.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ætɪk|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Carried out using a [[planned]], [[ordered]] [[procedure]]
# [[methodical|Methodical]], [[regular]] and [[orderly]]
# Of, or relating to [[taxonomic]] [[classification]]
# {{lb|en|proscribed}} Of, relating to, or being a [[system]]

